    "value": "prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>\nprefix esr: <http://elites_suisses/resource/>\nprefix eso: <http://elites_suisses/ontology/>\nselect * where {\n    ?s a eso:Person;\n       eso:name ?name;\n       eso:forename ?forename;\n       eso:birthDate ?db.\n} \norder by ?s\noffset 300\nlimit 100",
